  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help young women in Togo end computer illiteracy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The full-Blown and Independant Women  project provides a co-practising space for young computer illiterates women in the southern region of Togo. Through a well designed program, we train young women in computer skills such as coding, office automation and female leadership. More than thousands of young girls have been sensitised on the importance of ICT and good leadership to empower them being active players of a sustainable development.</narrative>
  </description>
